    "created_at": "2023-02-17T16:51:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-17T16:51:22Z",
    "body": "Yeah, so the previous focused element should be the left input which is `not a descendent of the dialog`. So dialog.close() won't move the focus to the right input.  ",
